{"title":"Sunday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/911740613/0/marginalrevolution~Sunday-assorted-links.html","date":1737920500000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://talentmarket.org/cato-econ-policy-analyst/\" target=\"_blank\">Cato ad for policy analyst in human progress and economics</a>.  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://talentmarket.org/cato-psych-policy-analyst/\" target=\"_blank\">for psychology</a>.</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3ryXyBKIkR73c7pzLHhott?si=jBqAVn9dSaCLJZ69zr18fA&amp;pi=u-NPFTmZGVRkuj&amp;nd=1&amp;dlsi=c94f628fe86c4642\" target=\"_blank\">Joe Boyd episode Spotify playlist</a>, put together by a CWT listener.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.npr.org/2025/01/14/nx-s1-5258907/james-webb-space-telescopes-little-red-dots-come-into-focus\" target=\"_blank\">Lots more black holes than we had thought?</a> And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.space.com/james-webb-space-telescope-little-red-dots-galaxies-black-hole-growth\" target=\"_blank\">more here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/victor207755822/status/1882757279436718454\" target=\"_blank\">DeepSeek okie-dokie</a>: “All I know is we keep pushing forward to make open-source AGI a reality for everyone.”  I believe them, the question is what counter-move the CCP will make now.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://tomforth.co.uk/whynorthenglandispoor/\" target=\"_blank\">A much longer follow-up post on why northern England is poor</a> (still no mention of drunks?).</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.constructionweekonline.com/news/sau